abstract: >-
  Data and code accompanying the research article "Quantifying resource
  dissipation applied to Li-ion battery recycling: Integrating Statistical
  Entropy Analysis and Exergy Cost Theory Insights into LCA". The repository
  contains the Statistical Entropy Analysis (SEA) of a simulated
  hydrometallurgical Li-ion battery recycling flowsheet, the Exergy Cost
  Analysis (ECA) thermoeconomic models, the Brightway LCA implementation
  with exergy-based resource indicators (CExD, CExD+), and the contribution
  analysis data exported from the Activity Browser (beta) "Tiers" panel.
